**Problem Constraints:**
- B ∈ {1,2}, N ∈ {128,256,512,1024}, c ∈ {128}, c_z ∈ {128,384,768}
- The input distribution will be sampled from a standard Normal distribution, or a heavy-tailed Cauchy distribution (gamma = 2).
