"""
Outgoing TriMul forward pass.

Fuses LayerNorm in Triton, packs the five input projections into one GEMM, writes
left/right activations in channel-major layout for strided batched GEMM, then fuses
the output LayerNorm and output gate before the final projection. Persistent caches
avoid repeated packing and workspace allocation across benchmark calls.
