large dense matrix products to cuBLAS. The five input projections are packed into
one GEMM, left/right are materialized in channel-major layout for efficient
strided batched GEMM over hidden channels, and the output LayerNorm is fused with
the output gate before the final projection. Persistent caches avoid repeated
