"""
TriMul outgoing forward pass optimized for SM80: normalize input with Triton,
pack the five input projections into one GEMM, materialize gated left/right in
channel-major layout for strided batched GEMMs over the sequence axis, then fuse
output LayerNorm and output gate before the final projection.
